453effc/tile_1790722446315.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=900&q=75&w=900","ep":"S05E15"},{"s":1795880945,"e":1795884305,"t":"Star Trek: Voyager: The Disease","st":"The Disease","d":"Kim puts his future with Voyager at risk when he chooses love over duty.","c":["Science fiction","Series","Classic Sci-Fi & Fantasy"],"i":"https://images.pluto.tv/series/6278c53e73a0a1001453effc/tile_1790722446315.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=900&q=75&w=900","ep":"S05E16"},{"s":1795884305,"e":1795887545,"t":"Star Trek: Voyager: Fair Haven","st":"Fair Haven","d":"Janeway’s holographic love interest becomes more than just a way to pass the time.","c":["Science fiction","Series","Classic Sci-Fi & Fantasy"],"i":"https://images.pluto.tv/series/6278c53e73a0a1001453effc/tile_1790722446315.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=900&q=75&w=900","ep":"S06E11"},{"s":1795887545,"e":1795890867,"t":"Star Trek: The Next Generation","st":"Elementary, Dear Data","d":"Data påtager sig rollen som Sherlock Holmes på holodækket for at opklare et mysterium, der truer dr. Pulaskis liv.","c":["Science fiction","Series"],"i":"https://images.pluto.tv/series/6a9011bd763ed26aa4fb10fb/tile_1787826621650.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=900&q=75&w=900","ep":"S02E03"},{"s":1795890867,"e":1795894195,"t":"Star Trek: The Next Generation","st":"The Measure Of A Man","d":"Da Data nægter at blive skilt ad i forskningsøjemed, bliver Picard sat til at forsvare hans rettigheder i en retssal.","c":["Science fiction","Series"],"i":"https://images.pluto.tv/series/6a9011bd763ed26aa4fb10fb/tile_1787826621650.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=900&q=75&w=900","ep":"S02E09"},{"s":1795894195,"e":1795897522,"t":"Star Trek: The Next Generation","st":"The Offspring","d":"Data bliver far, da han skaber en ny androide ved at kopiere sin egen neuralprogrammering.","c":["Science fiction","Series"],"i":"https://images.pluto.tv/series/6a9011bd763ed26aa4fb10fb/tile_1787826621650.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=900&q=75&w=900","ep":"S03E16"},{"s":17958